      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-da9f3097618cd108",
        "path_or_url": "weather.md",
        "section": "Weather decisions > Indoor instrument",
        "snippet": "## Indoor instrument\n\nAn instrument explicitly classified as indoor may continue during a wind suspension, provided its own safety interlocks remain closed. A roof visible as closed on the calendar does not establish indoor classification.\n\n",
        "version_binding": "unversioned",
        "content_sha256": "53e30807a958c0f4d1bafb64e4a339623137de6df701c540a96e56191ae144a9",
        "project_identity": "local:08d140cd5cd56c4dd1b02f2227e51cb0ac5cf89255461561a75bd7bb2961bb7d",
        "line_start": 9,
        "line_end": 12,
        "authority": "source_of_truth",
        "scope": "project",
        "source_uri": "docatlas://source/23183a75108874821f7ce171"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-c5f9e0e006826702",
        "path_or_url": "weather.md",
        "section": "Weather decisions > Suspension",
        "snippet": "## Suspension\n\nSuspend outdoor observations when the wind interlock opens. Preserve reservation identifiers during suspension. Resume only after the interlock closes and the duty operator records a restart approval.\n\n",
        "version_binding": "unversioned",
        "content_sha256": "41b22334169a925a4ebfdd741bd7e2d2e02527f613c05c0ba1443e15898e05c9",
        "project_identity": "local:08d140cd5cd56c4dd1b02f2227e51cb0ac5cf89255461561a75bd7bb2961bb7d",
        "line_start": 5,
        "line_end": 8,
        "authority": "source_of_truth",
        "scope": "project",
        "source_uri": "docatlas://source/71e0411adce9f5160f94c211"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-b3b2c2aa8dd9eb4f",
        "path_or_url": "weather.md",
        "section": "Weather decisions > Forecast display",
        "snippet": "## Forecast display\n\nThe forecast panel predicts wind for planning. A favourable forecast is not an interlock signal and cannot authorize a restart.\n",
        "version_binding": "unversioned",
        "content_sha256": "7dc6fd6c45091753fd2b1eb9535d4af46cf054e47725393c797e79cbb21ece31",
        "project_identity": "local:08d140cd5cd56c4dd1b02f2227e51cb0ac5cf89255461561a75bd7bb2961bb7d",
        "line_start": 13,
        "line_end": 15,
        "authority": "source_of_truth",
        "scope": "project",
        "source_uri": "docatlas://source/10a095cdf9477d0e8ce61a3d"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-cb38782494fce93b",
        "path_or_url": "reservations.md",
        "section": "Confirmed reservations > Training slots",
        "snippet": "## Training slots\n\nDaytime training slots can be reassigned by an instructor without the night-time approval workflow. This shortcut does not apply to confirmed observations.\n",
        "version_binding": "unversioned",
        "content_sha256": "597b27843cec4ac1030e6b1847f00bdaac77b7081f23254926e36c3d96c2f4a7",
        "project_identity": "local:08d140cd5cd56c4dd1b02f2227e51cb0ac5cf89255461561a75bd7bb2961bb7d",
        "line_start": 15,
        "line_end": 17,
        "authority": "source_of_truth",
        "scope": "project",
        "source_uri": "docatlas://source/09042645798f246ea5eef003"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-9f3daf40208e2c8d",
        "path_or_url": "architecture.md",
        "section": "Scheduler architecture > Prototype recovery",
        "snippet": "## Prototype recovery\n\nThe retired prototype cleared pending reservations when time drifted and restarted on its first local clock sample. These behaviours must not be used to recover the current gateway.\n",
        "version_binding": "unversioned",
        "content_sha256": "eea9d4694f180e578b91eca75f1f71ec4b1aa9d80de77fca233ba136423b5905",
        "project_identity": "local:08d140cd5cd56c4dd1b02f2227e51cb0ac5cf89255461561a75bd7bb2961bb7d",
        "line_start": 9,
        "line_end": 11,
        "authority": "source_of_truth",
        "scope": "project",
        "source_uri": "docatlas://source/c5d3aaa80aa37d4c2154b9bc"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-f2416760e194e497",
        "path_or_url": "architecture.md",
        "section": "Scheduler architecture > Planner",
        "snippet": "## Planner\n\nThe planner solves interval conflicts using instrument availability and reservation priority. It can compute a plan while execution is suspended. A computed plan is not permission to bypass a weather interlock or clock check.\n\n",
        "version_binding": "unversioned",
        "content_sha256": "cbd82cf29b36107f60622c2d1a01b2119bcea6d2aec9467258a9c870bf8c9b7b",
        "project_identity": "local:08d140cd5cd56c4dd1b02f2227e51cb0ac5cf89255461561a75bd7bb2961bb7d",
        "line_start": 5,
        "line_end": 8,
        "authority": "source_of_truth",
        "scope": "project",
        "source_uri": "docatlas://source/4ecb808e78aa392dec0c1249"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-870a67d90c766009",
        "path_or_url": "calendar.md",
        "section": "Calendar display > Timezones",
        "snippet": "## Timezones\n\nObservers may display the same reservation in different timezones. The stored start time and reservation identifier remain unchanged. Calendar export is a view, not a gateway command.\n",
        "version_binding": "unversioned",
        "content_sha256": "34e712841cb63d332c1c4c9941a0de25971a62fbfb981b3177bddfd369e0bccc",
        "project_identity": "local:08d140cd5cd56c4dd1b02f2227e51cb0ac5cf89255461561a75bd7bb2961bb7d",
        "line_start": 9,
        "line_end": 11,
        "authority": "source_of_truth",
        "scope": "project",
        "source_uri": "docatlas://source/ec9dfd83466cc183c2c3dc60"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-1d8adf7025958993",
        "path_or_url": "clock.md",
        "section": "Time coordination > Simulation clock",
        "snippet": "## Simulation clock\n\nThe simulator advances time manually and never waits for reference checks. Its accelerated clock is isolated from the real instrument gateway.\n",
        "version_binding": "unversioned",
        "content_sha256": "ddf4144fe71fcb3d2c941edef703699f08df5e000838bc469cf1ceab8025f51e",
        "project_identity": "local:08d140cd5cd56c4dd1b02f2227e51cb0ac5cf89255461561a75bd7bb2961bb7d",
        "line_start": 13,
        "line_end": 15,
        "authority": "source_of_truth",
        "scope": "project",
        "source_uri": "docatlas://source/c543a73409f218100a783663"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-f38cd6f471cd840c",
        "path_or_url": "calendar.md",
        "section": "Calendar display",
        "snippet": "# Calendar display\n\nThe calendar is a read-only projection of reservation and instrument state.\n\n",
        "version_binding": "unversioned",
        "content_sha256": "d96c3f96e95051fb44e94f14e15a0e2f861a18aa5dc27b89b689e1bd30ec4ea5",
        "project_identity": "local:08d140cd5cd56c4dd1b02f2227e51cb0ac5cf89255461561a75bd7bb2961bb7d",
        "line_start": 1,
        "line_end": 4,
        "authority": "source_of_truth",
        "scope": "project",
        "source_uri": "docatlas://source/5e0476495265830e80f9bfb7"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-cbd7763631b693ba",
        "path_or_url": "overview.md",
        "section": "Meridian scheduler > Services",
        "snippet": "## Services\n\nThe reservation service accepts requests, a planner assigns intervals, and an instrument gateway executes approved schedules. The calendar displays plans but cannot authorize execution.\n\n",
        "version_binding": "unversioned",
        "content_sha256": "1ca72dae5209f58066b3b26f65c5121af7b164cfe5d513ece62e528d4119f6c1",
        "project_identity": "local:08d140cd5cd56c4dd1b02f2227e51cb0ac5cf89255461561a75bd7bb2961bb7d",
        "line_start": 5,
        "line_end": 8,
        "authority": "source_of_truth",
        "scope": "project",
        "source_uri": "docatlas://source/3797ab873c80222d2778e30b"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-0c8f9b879ff0f781",
        "path_or_url": "architecture.md",
        "section": "Scheduler architecture",
        "snippet": "# Scheduler architecture\n\nMeridian separates ownership, planning, execution and display to permit independent restarts.\n\n",
        "version_binding": "unversioned",
        "content_sha256": "11ec815189c4e34c869d025c90c2bdedbea551aefbec896a743f6201b91f25e4",
        "project_identity": "local:08d140cd5cd56c4dd1b02f2227e51cb0ac5cf89255461561a75bd7bb2961bb7d",
        "line_start": 1,
        "line_end": 4,
        "authority": "source_of_truth",
        "scope": "project",
        "source_uri": "docatlas://source/aaf2e02168765a736b53a74f"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-b6237577d9b82b4d",
        "path_or_url": "reservations.md",
        "section": "Confirmed reservations > Locked instrument",
        "snippet": "## Locked instrument\n\nIf the instrument has an active maintenance lock, leave the transfer pending even after observer acceptance and operator approval. The lock must be cleared by the instrument team first.\n\n",
        "version_binding": "unversioned",
        "content_sha256": "773974301201448826d18ef3f8e17d0789e6a16dd164c55aef90d10eac10b6b2",
        "project_identity": "local:08d140cd5cd56c4dd1b02f2227e51cb0ac5cf89255461561a75bd7bb2961bb7d",
        "line_start": 11,
        "line_end": 14,
        "authority": "source_of_truth",
        "scope": "project",
        "source_uri": "docatlas://source/407cdaaec521a3ab481eced3"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-74830431fd790c37",
        "path_or_url": "calendar.md",
        "section": "Calendar display > Colours",
        "snippet": "## Colours\n\nAmber indicates a pending assignment, blue a confirmed slot, and grey a suspended interval. Changing a browser theme changes colours locally without changing instrument execution. A visual refresh cannot clear a maintenance lock.\n\n",
        "version_binding": "unversioned",
        "content_sha256": "be7b6499828323d5c9ae4826b54c68ff424788d979c8fc2fb586d3ff530f5a2d",
        "project_identity": "local:08d140cd5cd56c4dd1b02f2227e51cb0ac5cf89255461561a75bd7bb2961bb7d",
